OL,3,GNEWSAArtist creates world's biggest
OL,4,Asoil painting
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn artist has set a record for the
OL,7,Fworld's largest soil painting as he
OL,8,Fbids to raise awareness of how
OL,9,Fimportant the material is.
OL,11,FThe UK-based Official Record Breakers
OL,12,Fhas verified that organisation Save
OL,13,FSoil had surpassed the previous best of
OL,14,F59,458 sq cm (about 64 sq ft), with the
OL,15,Fnew painting measuring 61,000 sq cm
OL,16,F(about 65 sq ft).
OL,18,FPhil Lambert, who lives in Cardiff,
OL,19,Fused four types of soil and an upcycled
OL,20,Fwooden frame and canvas supplied by
OL,21,FOxford Wood Recycling.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
