OL,3,GNEWSAArtist creates world's biggest
OL,4,Asoil painting
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe artwork was created to raise
OL,7,Fawareness of the movement's call for
OL,8,Fsoil regeneration to be prioritised at
OL,9,Fthe 31st UN Climate Change Conference
OL,10,F(COP).
